validate:2 → 416 fused chunks
validate:3 → 425 fused chunks

Process one case at a time.

Do not perform fresh Qdrant retrieval, BM25 retrieval, query generation, RRF generation, candidate expansion, or index access beyond what is necessary to verify the frozen artifacts.

The candidate IDs, source payloads, supporting-query assignments, dense/BM25 ranks, RRF ranks/scores, and candidate ordering must remain identical to the frozen checkpoint.

